<body>

  <!-- Simple header / breadcrumb (edit or remove if you already have a global header) -->
  <header class="page-header">
    <h1><i class="fas fa-school"></i> Admission Details</h1>
  </header>

  <!-- Main content -->
  <main>
    <section class="admission-card">
      <h2>How to Apply</h2>

      <p>
        Admissions to Uluberia Government Polytechnic are <strong>strictly
        through <abbr title="Joint Entrance Examination for Polytechnics West Bengal">JEXPO</abbr></strong>,
        conducted by the <em>West Bengal State Council of Technical & Vocational Education and
        Skill Development</em>.
      </p>

      <p>
        Eligible candidates must <strong>register for the JEXPO examination</strong> and
        choose “Uluberia Government Polytechnic” during the counselling phase.
      </p>

      <p class="cta">
        <a href="https://scvtwb.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          Visit the Official WBSCT&VE&SD Website
          <i class="fas fa-arrow-up-right-from-square"></i>
        </a>
      </p>

      <h3>Important Dates <small>(tentative)</small></h3>
      <ul class="dates">
        <li><span>Application opens:</span> January – February</li>
        <li><span>Admit cards issued:</span> April</li>
        <li><span>JEXPO exam:</span> May (first Sunday)</li>
        <li><span>Results & counselling:</span> June – July</li>
        <li><span>Class commencement:</span> August</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Eligibility</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Passed Class 10 (Madhyamik) or equivalent with Mathematics,
            Physical Science & English.</li>
        <li>Minimum 35 % aggregate (no rounding).</li>
        <li>Age ≤ 21 years as on 01-07-YYYY (3-year relaxation for SC/ST candidates).</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Contact for Queries</h3>
      <address>
        Admission Cell, Uluberia Government Polytechnic<br>
        Boalia, Uluberia, Howrah – 711 316<br>
        Phone: +91 XXX XXXX XXX<br>
        E-mail:
        <a href="mailto:uluberiagovpoly@gmail.com">uluberiagovpoly@gmail.com</a>
      </address>
    </section>
  </main>



